        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ross Case, Slobodan Živojinović\n- Roles: former tennis player, singles player\n- Places: Australia\n- Events: 1985 Australian Open, 1986 Wimbledon Championships\n- Concepts: career-high ranking\n\nFacts:\n- Ross Case was born on 1 November 1951.\n- Ross Case is an Australian former tennis player.\n- In 1985, Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the Australian Open as a singles player.\n- In 1986, Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the Wimbledon Championships as a singles player.\n- Slobodan Živojinović achieved a career-high singles ranking of World No. 19.",
